&nbsp;

TL; DR

Shadow AI used to be confined to a few simple scenarios, such as AI chatbots and AI browser extensions. Today, it spans a broad spectrum of complex vectors, making it harder to detect and control. In tthis blog, we look at how employee security training, AI usage governance, and exposure management can help you tackle shadow AI successfully.

&nbsp;

